\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 8. What is a foreign key?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 A foreign key is a field that creates a relationship between two tables.\
Example:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
